WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.808 --> 00:00:03.820
(light sniffles)

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:06.232
- [Mark] Okay, let's
start; what was your name?

00:00:06.232 --> 00:00:07.065
- Hazel.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.083
And you are?

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:10.880
- [Mark] Mark.
- Nice to meet you.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:12.400
- [Mark] Nice to meet
you. All right, Hazel.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.107
Hazel, what neighborhood
did you grow up in?

00:00:15.107 --> 00:00:16.575
- [Hazel] I grew up in east L.A.

00:00:16.575 --> 00:00:17.533
- [Mark] East L.A. so-

00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:19.034
- [Hazel] I'm from Mecho Trece Gang

00:00:19.034 --> 00:00:22.841
- [Mark] Which gang?
- [Hazel] Mecho Trece

00:00:22.841 --> 00:00:23.730
(indistinct)

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:25.111
Everybody knows it.

00:00:25.111 --> 00:00:26.030
- [Mark] I don't.

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:27.077
I'm new at the gang (indistinct)

00:00:27.077 --> 00:00:28.577
- Some people know

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:31.360
- [Mark] What age were you
when you joined the gang?

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:32.609
- I was fourteen

00:00:32.609 --> 00:00:33.932
- [Mark] Fourteen?

00:00:33.932 --> 00:00:36.276
Tell me about your childhood a little bit.

00:00:36.276 --> 00:00:37.460
You grow up with both parents?

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:38.880
- I grew up with-

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:40.780
at fourteen I was on my own.

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:41.613
- [Mark] Fourteen.

00:00:41.613 --> 00:00:43.438
- I ended up being on my own because

00:00:43.438 --> 00:00:44.830
(loud traffic bustle)

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:45.663
I had a

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:48.370
I guess you could say

00:00:50.556 --> 00:00:53.200
I had a dysfunctional
family, that's for sure but

00:00:54.442 --> 00:00:55.275
- [Mark] Tell me how you grew up.

00:00:55.275 --> 00:00:56.108
Both parents? One parent?

00:00:57.245 --> 00:00:59.830
- When I was younger, I grew
up with, I had both my parents

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:02.753
but my dad's, even to this
day, he's a alcoholic.

00:01:03.921 --> 00:01:05.433
Growing up, he was a alcoholic.

00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:11.120
My mom, she was into drugs, you know.

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:11.997
My dad too.

00:01:15.022 --> 00:01:16.422
My parents used to be
swingers, apparently.

00:01:16.422 --> 00:01:17.255
- [Mark] Oh really?

00:01:17.255 --> 00:01:19.864
- That's kinda like a
no-no, like you don't just

00:01:19.864 --> 00:01:21.018
You know?

00:01:21.018 --> 00:01:23.810
I mean, not if you're
from the hood, though.

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:25.640
- [Mark] So alcohol and drugs were forever

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:27.240
in your parents' lives and then-

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:30.800
What were you on the street at? Fourteen?

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.920
- [Hazel] Fourteen. Trying
to, I guess look for

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:36.170
love and acceptance, you know? but

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:40.081
I found it in my hood, in my neighborhood,

00:01:40.081 --> 00:01:41.631
and I met a few people and just

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:44.210
I was always the one to
say that I never wanted

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:45.158
to be from the hood

00:01:45.158 --> 00:01:47.380
To have to show nobody where I'm from

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:49.710
or that I'm down from that because

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:52.180
I just handle stuff for everyone.

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:53.710
Things happen, because

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:54.720
that's the best way to do it, you know?

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:58.073
And that just shows that I'm
not a bitch ass punk, like

00:01:58.073 --> 00:02:00.156
I'm no punk bitch

00:02:00.156 --> 00:02:02.640
nobody's gonna tell me what to do and

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:03.473
I just,

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:07.180
I mean I'm not a dumb person,
I know right from wrong

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:12.180
and I know like morally my
beliefs and what I stand for

00:02:14.009 --> 00:02:17.134
but when it comes to my hood,
it's like family, you know?

00:02:17.134 --> 00:02:19.430
(loud background traffic noise)

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:20.980
I'm not gonna ever betray that.

00:02:25.754 --> 00:02:26.831
- [Mark] And prison time.

00:02:26.831 --> 00:02:28.470
(indistinct)

00:02:28.470 --> 00:02:30.670
- Prison, I've done
like three prison terms.

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:33.390
(indistinct)

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:36.360
For robbery, the first term.

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:39.070
And then another was a
home invasion and robbery.

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:39.903
And I have

00:02:41.101 --> 00:02:42.700
two cars I stole

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:48.130
I guess nobody ever says that, you know

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:49.610
that's something they wanna grow up doing,

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:51.210
it's just

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:54.530
stuff happens, shit happens,
you know life happens and

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:56.940
for gang members like us

00:02:58.890 --> 00:02:59.910
it's not a choice.

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:01.730
You just do what you
gotta do, no matter what.

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:03.740
For your family

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:06.070
and for your brothers and sisters.

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:07.390
You know, like your hood.

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:09.240
- [Mark] Is a female gang
member treated differently

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:10.263
than a male?

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:15.243
- They are, a lot in ways.
Especially back, way back.

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:19.890
Now it's more like we have
to fuckin' be as good,

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:23.630
we have to be as hard,
or as ready to, like,

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:25.710
to bust a cap on someone almost

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:30.370
You gotta just be quick
to be a killer and it's-

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:32.205
but that's every day life.
You know what I mean?

00:03:32.205 --> 00:03:36.603
Where I grew up, where I come
from, that's just automatic.

00:03:37.516 --> 00:03:40.443
It's like in your basic tools for life.

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:42.823
Number one, survival.

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:47.190
Either you're a shark, or you're gonna be

00:03:48.183 --> 00:03:49.128
- [Mark] Eaten.

00:03:49.128 --> 00:03:50.510
- Eaten, yeah.

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:52.150
I know that if it gets down to you or me,

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:53.950
it's not gonna be me, I'll say that.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.940
Do I dance with the devil
on a daily basis? Yes.

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:03.060
Playing with my life, period,
is a ballsy thing, you know?

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:05.190
It's a ballsy thing to
live through the life

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:07.903
that we have to live through.
In today's times and-

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:11.326
I don't know.

00:04:11.326 --> 00:04:12.420
Don't get me wrong.

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:14.603
What I have, what I do,

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:17.380
how I react,

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:20.163
it's a product of my
environment, you know?

00:04:24.176 --> 00:04:26.026
Like, just being in prison, you know.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:31.220
We heard that a baby
case was coming up, and

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:33.941
a lot of times we don't, like it's not-

00:04:33.941 --> 00:04:34.774
(indistinct)

00:04:34.774 --> 00:04:35.607
"oh, fuck it.

00:04:35.607 --> 00:04:36.700
Let me go pluck this
bitch cause I know I can."

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:41.395
No, I wasn't raised like
that in my hood generation.

00:04:41.395 --> 00:04:44.360
There's older women that
sat me down, you know.

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:46.213
When I got jumped into my
neighborhood, there was-

00:04:46.213 --> 00:04:47.046
- [Mark] When you what?

00:04:47.046 --> 00:04:48.720
- When I got jumped into
my hood, at fourteen,

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:51.183
I got jumped in by two guys and two girls.

00:04:53.157 --> 00:04:54.640
That don't mean nothing if you're a guy.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.540
You're gonna check the honey,

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:57.373
you're gonna go check her right now.

00:04:57.373 --> 00:05:00.600
You're gonna fuckin' give
it to her, just the same way

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.600
I would, or you know, or he would.

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:05.160
So, like, everybody is treated
the same way in that aspect.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:08.480
But, like, when it comes to-

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:11.200
we have ethics and codes
when it comes to gangs, too.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.890
We don't, you're not supposed to, like-

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:14.520
you don't-

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.840
We get checked, or we could
get, we could even get

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:20.220
a green light on us, if we
shoot and do a drive-by,

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:22.690
which drive-bys are no longer allowed, but

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:24.250
if we were, and there was a child,

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:27.100
that's already a dead man
walking, you know, pretty much.

00:05:28.985 --> 00:05:30.730
But like in prison,

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:32.138
We get word that somebody's a baby case

00:05:32.138 --> 00:05:35.990
and that they need to be taken
care of because, you know?

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:40.035
That's an innocent child, and
it don't matter who it is,

00:05:40.035 --> 00:05:42.050
who they know, doesn't
matter; that's a dead-

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:44.663
Once they hit ground and they're
not gonna know it's coming.

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:49.563
I had like six people just stab,

00:05:49.563 --> 00:05:52.800
stab her just as she
came up to the jail hole.

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:57.020
It's sad when like

00:05:59.934 --> 00:06:00.767
you can see things like that

00:06:00.767 --> 00:06:02.130
and it's normal to you.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:07.130
It doesn't affect you anymore
because you've just been so-

00:06:07.460 --> 00:06:10.751
I don't know, like people
who go to the war, you know?

00:06:10.751 --> 00:06:12.810
I look at it the same way.
This is my war ground;

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:16.580
and I know the best ways to go about it

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:18.490
with the people I battle.

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:21.657
- [Mark] Have you ever killed anybody?

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:26.257
- I can't say that
anybody has ever died from

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:31.230
whatever I've done to them but

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:34.100
I know that they always,
they always had it coming.

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:36.423
It wasn't just because, just to do it.

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:40.720
I mean that's something,

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:43.010
me, I have to deal with
for the rest of my life.

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:45.070
If I know I've killed somebody

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:47.460
or if I know that because of the things

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:48.293
I've done to that person

00:06:48.293 --> 00:06:51.450
that maybe they didn't wake
up the next day, whatever.

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:54.373
I don't know, I've never
been told that like-

00:06:55.358 --> 00:06:57.838
I've never been convicted of it, so

00:06:57.838 --> 00:06:59.984
- [Mark] Never been caught.

00:06:59.984 --> 00:07:00.880
- There's a lot of us
that haven't been caught

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:03.310
for a lot of things, you know?

00:07:04.901 --> 00:07:06.801
Life evens out that way, you know?

00:07:06.801 --> 00:07:08.840
- [Mark] Do you have kids of your own?

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:10.472
(Clears throat)

00:07:10.472 --> 00:07:11.305
- I do

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:14.850
(laughs nervously)

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:18.740
It's crazy cause being a mom and being

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:24.396
in the gang life, being
active, so to speak,

00:07:24.396 --> 00:07:27.050
(clears throat)

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:29.690
a lot of people will respect the fact that

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:31.300
I won't do certain things.

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.670
My hood, they'll respect certain things

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:34.870
that I choose not to do.

00:07:38.533 --> 00:07:41.491
I explain to whoever it is that like

00:07:41.491 --> 00:07:44.291
"hey, I don't feel comfortable
doing this person because

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:46.500
that's some personal shit,

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:47.870
and that has nothing to do with the hood,

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:49.750
so like, I'm not gonna".

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:52.210
Or respect the fact
that I'm, you know, now,

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:53.920
I'm a little more chilled
now than I was back then.

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:55.770
I was a hot head back then, you know?

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:58.520
Capped people right there,
right in front of their face.

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:01.230
Just because I fucking got mad or like

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:04.350
jacked somebody just because,
you know I'm sick of them

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:05.183
I fucking,

00:08:06.135 --> 00:08:10.870
it's not about nothing else
except me getting what I want

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:12.000
at the time that I need it.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.110
And if it's money for my kids

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:18.110
or if it's money that I need
to help my homeboy's mom

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:19.800
or like anything like that.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:22.733
It's just, it'll happen.
I'll make it happen. And-

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:25.940
for me, because I'm hot-headed

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:27.803
I don't think about it, I just do it.

00:08:30.971 --> 00:08:32.600
I don't know, I guess

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:38.340
I knew what I signed up when
I signed up for it, you know?

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:40.180
I wanted all this.

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:44.170
I thrive for this stuff.
It's like a person that's

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:47.923
fucking addicted to
drugs, it's like a drug.

00:08:47.923 --> 00:08:49.131
- [Mark] You think
anything in your childhood,

00:08:49.131 --> 00:08:51.131
the way you were raised,

00:08:52.147 --> 00:08:56.013
that it has something to do with that?

00:08:56.013 --> 00:08:59.493
- [Hazel] Well my family,
for one. Because they just-

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:02.170
they're there but they're never there.

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:04.110
They're not there at all.

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:05.100
I look at it like this-

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:07.370
if my parents, or my dad,

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:09.812
whoever gave a fuck about
me really be out there,

00:09:09.812 --> 00:09:13.090
how come they weren't like
those other moms that had-

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:16.290
my friends had moms that fuckin'
cooked for them every day.

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:18.290
Made sure they fuckin'
ate. If they weren't home,

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:19.920
they were calling
everybody looking for them.

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:21.660
I didn't have that. Like-

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:24.560
maybe cause they were too
busy in their own shit, but

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:28.227
either way, I went
looking for what I needed.

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:31.708
I can't say it was wrong, but I can't say-

00:09:31.708 --> 00:09:36.210
I don't think I'm an angel,
you know? Or nor my friends.

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:39.313
But I know that we stand
for something, I do.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.837
When it comes to my neighborhood

00:09:42.837 --> 00:09:44.310
I look at them like my
brothers and sisters.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:46.240
I'll treat them just the way
I would treat my own family

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:50.110
and if anybody got crazy with them

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:52.857
fucking locked up on them, I
would be right there with them.

00:09:52.857 --> 00:09:54.700
Believe it or not, the
first time I got locked up

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:58.100
with anybody in my life was
when I got jumped into my hood.

00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:59.463
I never had a fight before.

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:04.470
I don't know if it was
just me holding back

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:06.431
cause I don't really bother nobody, but

00:10:06.431 --> 00:10:07.800
- [Mark] So that was your initiation?

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:11.040
- My initiation, yeah,
was getting down with two

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.647
of my homeboys and two of my homegirls.

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:14.490
Cause like I said, I was always like-

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:16.770
- [Mark] So the fight was the initiation?

00:10:16.770 --> 00:10:18.607
- Yeah, you get jumped.

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:20.720
It's not jumped

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:24.285
but it looks like that to
people that don't know.

00:10:24.285 --> 00:10:28.630
But like, I mean, it's our
own brothers and sisters.

00:10:28.630 --> 00:10:30.790
People that are gonna
love you and fight for you

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:32.360
and die for you if-

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:35.210
I mean, they have that right, you know

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:37.760
to set you straight, so

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:41.250
Me, I've had to be set
straight a lot of times

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:44.081
because I'm just a little
firecracker, you know

00:10:44.081 --> 00:10:47.581
I don't think about
stuff, but I don't know.

00:10:47.581 --> 00:10:50.760
I think when I was about nine or ten,

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:54.620
I got in trouble because
I fought some girl.

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:58.930
Okay so it's before then, but
when I was like nine or ten

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:01.200
I don't think it was
really a fight though, like

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:02.140
you're a kid, you know?

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:05.400
But I just had a lot of
anger ever since I was a kid

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:08.770
I think that's what's fueled
me to boss up on bitches

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:12.807
Just you know, like "What?
What'd you say bitch? What's up?"

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:17.490
Cause me, I can talk, don't get me wrong

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:21.900
I know how to talk, I can't
talk when it comes to arguing.

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:23.832
I'll start stuttering. And to me I'm like-

00:11:23.832 --> 00:11:24.881
- [Guest] Cause that's
how mad you're getting?

00:11:24.881 --> 00:11:25.714
- Yeah, I ain't tryna
look like a little bitch

00:11:25.714 --> 00:11:27.606
(indistinct)

00:11:27.606 --> 00:11:29.230
"Fool, you punked out, oh hell naw"

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:30.874
No, that's not me. I'm like, no.

00:11:30.874 --> 00:11:31.707
(laughs)

00:11:31.707 --> 00:11:32.620
- [Guest] I think that's how
everybody gets when they're-

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:35.560
- And I think that's what kinda helps too.

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:36.929
Kinda gives you that
little boost. You're like,

00:11:36.929 --> 00:11:38.680
"Fuck that. I can't
look like a little bitch

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:39.826
in front of the homies"
So you're like fuck that.

00:11:39.826 --> 00:11:40.814
"What?!"

00:11:40.814 --> 00:11:41.800
And you just take off, you know.

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:46.740
